{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 18th century America, the fires of the American Revolution have erupted. Brother has taken up arms against brother in the clouds of gunpowder and skulduggery. But in this chaos, a crafty and pragmatic smuggler could make his fortune - and perhaps, even fall in love! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage a trade ship and run cargo from Quebec City to Spanish Louisiana, buying low and selling high.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Market prices are volatile, both for you and rival captains!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Date one of the many Colonial-era state-chans like Loyalist-chan or New Jersey-chan!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose to align yourself with either the Revolutionaries or the British Empire and help tilt the war in their favor! Other minor factions such as the Spanish Empire, the Iroquois, and the Dutch Republic are also likely to play a role...</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3789080?t=1773244720","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789080/a0666bd79214277b6de802861671dbb73bf6e572/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773244720","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789080/11913022a34e3ffff127efed38bb8c528b002c62/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773244720","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789080/11913022a34e3ffff127efed38bb8c528b002c62/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773244720","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4129720,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 18th century America, the fires of the American Revolution have erupted. Brother has taken up arms against brother in the clouds of gunpowder and skulduggery. But in this chaos, a crafty and pragmatic smuggler could make his fortune - and perhaps, even fall in love! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage a trade ship and run cargo from Quebec City to Spanish Louisiana, buying low and selling high.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Market prices are volatile, both for you and rival captains!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Date one of the many Colonial-era state-chans like Loyalist-chan or New Jersey-chan!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose to align yourself with either the Revolutionaries or the British Empire and help tilt the war in their favor! Other minor factions such as the Spanish Empire, the Iroquois, and the Dutch Republic are also likely to play a role...</p></li></ul>","developers":["HIROTONFA"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789080/bab4541e6bfb127d97480081b2fe566458d4dd80/header.jpg?t=1773244720","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3789080/1407918218/1d7c63997be762709c94b2f1317673a68a9d8ff5/1758232971/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758294360","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3789080/1407918218/1d7c63997be762709c94b2f1317673a68a9d8ff5/1758232971/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758294360","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3789080/1407918218/1d7c63997be762709c94b2f1317673a68a9d8ff5/1758232971/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758294360","id":2572